ww.meetup.com/meetup-group-mbglenao/events/316779750/","description":"The Church of St. Timothy is excited to offer support to newcomers in Canada. Our goal is to provide conversational language practice through informal instruction and feedback in a welcoming and diverse community. All levels welcome!\n\nWe invite all new-comers, English language students, visitors to Canada, parents of children temporarily attending schools in Toronto, international university students, and anyone looking to enhance their language skills.\nWe aim to build community where friendships can flourish, in order to help participants establish meaningful connections, learn about life in Toronto, and access practical resources as you settle in to this new city and country.\n\nWe begin every Tuesday at 10:00 a.m. with time to socialize. Our formal program begins at 10:30 a.m.\nEach week we will have different activities and topics, including practicing English conversation, reading short articles, learning about common pronunciation and grammar mistakes, etc.\nOur volunteers would love to get to know you and offer gentle and constructive feedback to help you improve your English!","startDate":"2026-10-20T14:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"100 Old Orchard Grove","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"100 Old Orchard Grove, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Church of St. Timothy, North Toronto Meetup Group","url":"https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-mbglenao/"},"performer":"Church of St. Timothy, North Toronto Meetup Group"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Toronto Urban Playground Parkour Fundamentals","url":"https://www.meetup.com/the-urban-playground-parkour-basics-crew/events/316673224/","description":"If you have ever watched someone navigate a park bench or a concrete ledge and thought that looks like fun, this session is for you. We are getting together at the park to break down the fundamentals of parkour in a way that is accessible and straightforward. Whether you are completely new to movement or just want to brush up on your landings, rolls, and basic vaults, we keep the focus on building confidence and control in a supportive environment.\n\nExpect to spend the time moving at your own pace while we work through some drills together. We prioritize safety and technical understanding over flashy tricks, so you do not need to be an athlete to join in. Just bring comfortable shoes, some water, and an open mind. If you have been looking for a reason to get outside and explore the city through a different lens, we would love to have you join us. Please let us know if you can make it by clicking the RSVP button so we know how many people to expect.\n\nSpots are limited and registration is required. Please register at the link below to hold yours.\n\n[Click To Save Your Spot](https://remoteready.io/neo_registration?event_title=Toronto%20Urban%20Playground%20Parkour%20Fundamentals&src=the-urban-playground-parkour-basics-crew)","startDate":"2026-10-20T14:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-5-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"HHGF+3P Toronto","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"HHGF+3P Toronto, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Urban Playground Parkour Basics Crew","url":"https://www.meetup.com/the-urban-playground-parkour-basics-crew/"},"performer":"The Urban Playground Parkour Basics Crew"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"NEW TIME!! FREE Spanish, English, and French Oral Conversational Class 4 Adults!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/free-frenchspanish-classes-for-adults/events/316781455/","description":"\\*These classes are not a language exchange, but instead are meant to be a step in between so that students feel confident maintaining in depth and grammatically correct oral conversations outside of class\\*\n\n\\***Meetup event numbers only tend to show new students registering and do not include returning students attending class.** **Per class, there is an average of 7 students.** The first 2 classes are free and then only cost between $18 and $35 depending on which type of class you want to continue with\\*\n\nThese French, English (For Spanish and French speakers only), and Spanish classes are primarily meant for adults who are travellers, or who are planning to live in a French, English, or Spanish-speaking country. The classes are primarily oral-based through guided conversations. They will teach you how to handle conversations in situations such as **\"Going to the Convenience Store\"**, **\"Making Plans\"**, **\"Negotiating Prices\"**, and **\"Going out for a Drink\"**. To ensure that students get used to using the language automatically, students will learn to maintain contextual conversations with timing before moving on to the next lesson. Call (647)787-9953, e-mail us info@monkeylingo.ca, or visit monkeylingo.ca for more information! **Online and private classes are also available!**\n\nNo other language classes are as conversational as these ones. We guarantee it! Cheap parking can be found using the \"Spot Hero\" app.","startDate":"2026-10-20T16:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"600 Bay St.","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"T