it to see you there!","startDate":"2026-10-20T17:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Miles Nadal JCC","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"750 Spadina Ave - M5S 2J2, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Drop-in Recreation - Volleyball, Basketball & Pickleball","url":"https://www.meetup.com/downtown-miles-nadal-jcc-sports-and-recreation/"},"performer":"Drop-in Recreation - Volleyball, Basketball & Pickleball"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"9-Night Spain & Morocco Cruise on Norwegian Star","url":"https://www.meetup.com/youdoyoutravel/events/316461038/","description":"**Norwegian Star • 9 Nights**\n**Europe: Spain & Morocco**\n**October 20 – October 29, 2026**\nSail from **Lisbon, Portugal to Barcelona, Spain** aboard Norwegian Star and explore a beautiful mix of destinations across Portugal, the Canary Islands, Morocco, and Spain.\nFrom the architecture and coastal scenery of Santa Cruz de Tenerife to the markets of Casablanca and the beaches and cuisine of Cádiz, this itinerary offers a great mix of culture, history, and time at sea.\n\n### CRUISE PRICING\n\nPrice per person, based on double occupancy.\n**Inside – Category IA**\n**$1,927 CAD per person**\n**Oceanview – Category OA**\n**$2,250 CAD per person**\n**Balcony – Category BA**\n**$3,453 CAD per person**\nPricing and availability are subject to change.\n\n### ITINERARY\n\n**Day 1 — Lisbon, Portugal**\n**Day 2 — At Sea**\n**Day 3 — Santa Cruz de Tenerife, Spain**\n**Day 4 — Arrecife, Spain**\n**Day 5 — Agadir, Morocco**\n**Day 6 — Casablanca, Morocco**\n**Day 7 — Cádiz / Seville, Spain**\n**Day 8 — Motril, Spain**\n**Day 9 — At Sea**\n**Day 10 — Barcelona, Spain**\nExplore the vibrant markets of Morocco, enjoy the scenery and architecture of the Canary Islands, and experience some of Spain’s most beautiful coastal cities before arriving in Barcelona.\n\n### **INTERESTED IN JOINING?**\n\n[www.youdoyoutravel.ca](http://www.youdoyoutravel.ca/)\n**Bonnie Fowler**\nProud Travel Agent of Travel Agent Next Door\nTelephone - 647-213-6968\n1003-55 York Street\nToronto, Ontario, M5J 1R7\nTICO: 5003172","startDate":"2026-10-20T20:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-3-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":""}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"You Do You Travel and Events","url":"https://www.meetup.com/youdoyoutravel/"},"performer":"You Do You Travel and Events"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"FREE Spanish, English, and French Oral Conversational Class 4 Adults!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/free-frenchspanish-classes-for-adults/events/316785806/","description":"\\*These classes are not a language exchange, but instead are meant to be a step in between so that students feel confident maintaining in depth and grammatically correct oral conversations outside of class\\*\n\n\\***Meetup event numbers only tend to show new students registering and do not include returning students attending class.** **Per class, there is an average of 7 students.** The first 2 classes are free and then only cost between $18 and $35 depending on which type of class you want to continue with\\*\n\nThese French, English (For Spanish and French speakers only), and Spanish classes are primarily meant for adults who are travellers, or who are planning to live in a French, English, or Spanish-speaking country. The classes are primarily oral-based through guided conversations. They will teach you how to handle conversations in situations such as **\"Going to the Convenience Store\"**, **\"Making Plans\"**, **\"Negotiating Prices\"**, and **\"Going out for a Drink\"**. To ensure that students get used to using the language automatically, students will learn to maintain contextual conversations with timing before moving on to the next lesson. Call (647)787-9953, e-mail us info@monkeylingo.ca, or visit monkeylingo.ca for more information! **Online and private classes are also available!**\n\nNo other language classes are as conversational as these ones. We guarantee it! Cheap parking can be found using the \"Spot Hero\" app.","startDate":"2026-10-20T20:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"600 Bay St.","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"600 Bay St., Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Free Conversational Spanish, English, French Class 4 Adults!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/free-frenchspanish-classes-for-adults/"},"performer":"Free Conversational Spanish, English, French Class 4 Adults!"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Le French Meetup avec Angélique - 3 $","url":"https://www.meetup.com/le-french-meetup-avec-angelique/events/316363169/","description":"Chers ami(e)s,\n\nJe pense que cela serait bien de mettre en place un abonnement annuel au Meetup: 36 dollars pour 12 mois de Meetup par personne à partir d'avril 2025. Comme ça, je pourrai continuer à utiliser le site Meetup pour nos rencontres mensuelles. Pour ceux qui ne viennent que quelques fois par an, je les ferai payer 3 dollars à chaque fois. Je vous demanderai lors de notre prochaine rencontre de me payer en espèce ou par transfert interac à angelfirouzi@gmail.com la somme de 36 dollars.\n\nMerci\nAngélique\n\nDear friends,\n\nI think it would be a good idea to put in place a yearly subscription to our Meetup: 36 dollars for 12 months of Meetup starting this month of April 2025. Like this I will be able to use the Meetup website for our monthly meetings. For those who come once in a while, I will make them pay 3 dollars each time. I will ask you at our next meeting to pay me 36 dollars in cash or by Interac transfer to angelfirouzi@gmail.com.\n\nThank you,\nAngélique\n\nHi All,\n\nAre you looking to speak and excel in your French? The French Meetup with Angélique meets all your expectations. Join us the third Wednesday of every month at 5 pm. This is a great opportunity to meet in a francophone setting, converse in French and socialize in a friendly and instructive environment.\nThere is a 3 dollar fee per person for each meetup to cover the annual fee of the meetup.com website. There is also a requirement to consume a minimum of 1 item per person.\nLooking forward to meeting you.\nAngélique\n\nBonjour à toutes et à tous,\nVous voulez parler ou pratiquer votre français? Le French Meetup avec Angélique vous donne cette occasion de discuter en français et socialiser dans une bonne ambiance amicale, amusante et instructive, tous les troisième mercredis du mois à 17h. L’esprit de convivialité que je propose nous permettra à toutes et à tous de nous reposer tout en ayant une notion de français. Je compte sur vous!\nUne participation de 3 dollars par session et par personne pour payer les frais annuels du site Meetup.com ainsi qu’un minimum d’une consommation sont requises.\nAu plaisir de vous voir bientôt.\nAngélique","startDate":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Cream n Sugar Cafe and Bistro","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Richmond Hill","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"8910 Yonge St, Richmond Hill, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Le French Meetup avec Angélique","url":"https://www.meetup.com/le-french-meetup-avec-angelique/"},"performer":"Le French Meetup avec Angélique"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"MASSAGE CLUB & BODY PSYCHOTHERAPY","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-tantra-circle/events/316786142/","description":"MASSAGE CLUB & BODY PSYCHOTHERAPY\nThis is the project overview only!\nDates might change.\n\nTo find the exact dates and register for the event, please join our Telegram group:\n\nT.me/TorontoTantra\nT.me/AndyTherapist\n\nMASSAGE & BODY PSYCHOTHERAPY CLUB\n\nHave you ever explored massage not only as relaxation, but also as a way to reconnect with your body, emotions, and nervous system?\n\nIn Toronto there are many massage services, but not many spaces where people can safely learn, practice and exchange conscious touch together.\n\nWe would like to create such a club.\n\nA warm, respectful space for people interested in massage, bodywork, somatic practices and body-oriented psychotherapy.\n\nYou don’t need professional massage experience. Beginners are welcome.\n\nJoin our group and leave a message if you would like to be added to the waiting list.\nt.me/TorontoTantra\n\nAbout this event\n\n• What is the Massage & Body Psychotherapy Club?\n\nIt is a practice evening where we explore conscious touch, relaxation, massage techniques and simple body-oriented therapeutic exercises.\n\nThe purpose is not only to relax muscles, but also to develop better contact with your body, reduce stress and learn how safe touch can support emotional regulation and connection.\n\n• What will we be doing?\n\nDepending on the evening, we may explore:\n\n- simple relaxation massage techniques\n- conscious touch and body awareness\n- grounding and nervous-system regulation\n- breathing and relaxation exercises\n- somatic and body-psychotherapy exercises\n- practicing giving and receiving\n- communication of boundaries and consent\n\nPractices can be done in pairs or small groups and will be guided step by step.\n\n• Massage exchange\n\nOne of the main parts of the club is a structured massage exchange.\n\nYou can experience both sides:\ngiving touch and receiving touch.\n\nThe goal is not to perform a “perfect massage,” but to become more sensitive to another person’s body, learn to listen through your hands, communicate clearly and discover what kind of touch feels supportive.\n\nImportant terms & agreements\n\nConsent first: every exercise and every touch is optional.\n\nRespect boundaries: you can say yes, no, stop, slower, softer or change the practice at any moment.\n\nKeep it therapeutic: this is a bodywork and personal-development space, not a sexual service or dating event.\n\nStay present: no alcohol or recreational drugs during the event.\n\nConfidentiality: personal experiences shared during the practice stay within the group.\n\nThe club may be interesting for people curious about:\n\nmassage • bodywork • somatic therapy • body-oriented psychotherapy • conscious touch • nervous-system regulation • relaxation • tantra-inspired body awareness\n\nDetails, dates and registration:\nt.me/TorontoTantra","startDate":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":""}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"T.me/TorontoTantra Circle","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toronto-tantra-circle/"},"performer":"T.me/TorontoTantra Circle"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Stitch & B*tch - Tuesdays, 5-9PM (Bi-Weekly)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/m-b-g-u/events/316746294/","description":"We know you have a stash of unfinished WIPs and UFOs, but can't find the motivation to finish them.\n\nCome out and stitch with us! We'll be hosting a bi-weekly social stitch night to allow for folks to body double while knitting, crocheting, drawing, and more! It's a great opportunity to meet new people, exchange tips and tricks, all while working through your backlog of projects.\n\nDon't have a fiber project? Bring a canvas, ipad, some blank sneakers, or any other project.\n\nSeating fee of $5+tax/person.\nIf you do not RSVP for the event OR pre-purchase your event ticket on our site by noon on the day of the event the price will be $8+ tax.\n\nHope to see you there!","startDate":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"LVLUP GAMES","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Mississauga","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"833 Westlock Rd Unit #9, Mississauga, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Mississauga Board Gamers United","url":"https://www.meetup.com/m-b-g-u/"},"performer":"Mississauga Board Gamers United"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"North York Boardgaming","url":"https://www.meetup.com/geekzunited/events/316786489/","description":"**Time:** 5:30pm until 9:30pm every Tuesday evening\n\n​**Location:** Mitchell Field Community Centre\n\n**Address:** 89 Church Ave., a couple blocks east of Yonge Street\n\n[​](https://store.401games.ca/)**​​Transit:** About a 15 minute walk from either North York or Finch stations\n\n**Parking:** There are 2 parking lots near the community centre. Main lot along the east side of the building is nearest the main entrance. The other lot is located near the Arena.\n\n**Games**\n\